  "a84": {
   "titolo": "Generate longer AI videos with Omni 1.2 Flash in Google Vids at no cost.",
   "link": "https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/workspace/omni-1-2-flash-google-vids/",
   "data": "2026-11-05T20:00:00+00:00",
   "testo": "Generate longer AI videos with Omni 1.2 Flash in Google Vids at no cost. Google Vids, our video creation and editing tool, now runs on Google's newest video generation model: Omni 1.2 Flash. Starting today, anyone with a Google account or Google Workspace subscription can generate up to three 15-second videos per month in Vids at no cost. With Omni 1.2 in Google Vids, you can now bring your ideas to life in so many more ways: - Create your product promos in one go. Produce professional, quick-turn social content and promotional materials without a single cut. - Transform static imagery into engaging videos. Upload reference images from anything — a trip, a school project, or learning materials — and your characters and scenes will stay consistent, from the first frame to the last. - Make clips that sound more natural. With improved speech narration, your social clips, concept explainers, and teaser videos feel like something you recorded yourself. If you can describe it, you can make it. Try Google Vids out at vids.new.",
   "fonte": "Google (blog ufficiale)",
   "tipo": "ufficiale",
   "solo_titolo": false,
   "categoria": "Laboratori",
   "id": "a84",
